==Major events==
{{spoilers}}
===Act I===
* [[Alain]] is introduced.
* Alain meets [[Mairin]], a beginning {{pkmn|Trainer}}.
* Alain finds a [[Gyaradosite]].
* Mairin {{pkmn2|caught|catches}} a {{p|Flabébé}}, which she [[nickname]]s "Bébé".
* Alain has a {{pkmn|battle}} against [[Siebold]] of the [[Kalos]] [[Elite Four]], but loses.
* Mairin decides to travel with Alain.

===Act II===
* [[Alain]] and [[Mairin]] arrive in the [[Hoenn]] [[region]].
* {{an|Steven Stone|Steven}} is revealed to own a {{Shiny}} {{TP|Steven|Metagross}}, a [[Key Stone]], and a [[Metagrossite]].
* Alain and {{TP|Alain|Charizard}} battle Steven, but the {{pkmn|battle}} is interrupted by [[Lysandre]].
* Steven is revealed to have replaced [[Wallace]] as the reigning [[Hoenn League]] {{pkmn|Champion}}.
* Alain is revealed to be working with Lysandre and [[Lysandre Labs]], and to have received his [[Mega Ring]] and [[Charizardite X]] from him.
* {{DL|Super-ancient Pokémon (XY series)|Rayquaza}} attacks Alain and his company during their research, becoming [[Mega Evolution|Mega]] Rayquaza in the process.
* Alain and Steven attempt to battle Mega Rayquaza, but are quickly overwhelmed.
* Lysandre orders Alain to go to [[Rustboro City]].

===Act III===
* [[Alain]], [[Mairin]], and {{an|Steven Stone|Steven}} arrive in [[Rustboro City]].
* Alain and Steven battle [[Primal Reversion|Primal]] {{DL|Super-ancient Pokémon (XY series)|Groudon}} and Primal {{DL|Super-ancient Pokémon (XY series)|Kyogre}}.
* [[Mega Evolution|Mega]] {{DL|Super-ancient Pokémon (XY series)|Rayquaza}} reappears, stopping the rampage between Primal Groudon and Primal Kyogre.
* [[Lysandre]] obtains the legendary [[Giant Rock]].
* {{an|Professor Sycamore}} learns that Alain can use Mega Evolution.
* Alain separates from Mairin and returns to [[Lysandre Labs]] to train.
* Mairin returns to [[Kalos]] with Steven to search for Alain.

===Act IV===
* [[Alain]] and [[Mairin]] reunite.
* Alain has a battle with [[Malva]] of the [[Kalos]] [[Elite Four]] and wins.
* [[Chespie]] meets a [[Squishy|Zygarde Core]] and helps it escape from [[Lysandre Labs]], but becomes ill in the process and falls into a coma.
* [[Lysandre]] is revealed to own a [[Key Stone]].
* Alain sets off on a quest to restore Chespie's health.

